{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS创建并立即加载Launch服务。对应需求：持久化。官方：Launch Service Creation and Immediate Loading。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.file*","logs-endpoint.events.process*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS创建并立即加载Launch服务","references":["https://developer.apple.com/library/archive/documentation/MacOSX/Conceptual/BPSystemStartup/Chapters/CreatingLaunchdJobs.html"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"082e3f8c-6f80-485c-91eb-5b112cb79b28","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 持久化","来源: 默认","对应需求: 持久化"],"type":"eql","query":"sequence by host.id with maxspan=30s\n [file where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.action == \"launch_daemon\"] by process.entity_id\n [process where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.type in (\"start\", \"process_started\") and process.name == \"launchctl\" and process.args in (\"load\", \"bootstrap\")] by process.parent.entity_id\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS创建并立即加载Launch服务\n\n### 为何重要\n在重启或登录后保持立足点\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1543","name":"Create or Modify System Process","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1543/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1543.001","name":"Launch Agent","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1543/001/"},{"id":"T1543.004","name":"Launch Daemon","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1543/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1569","name":"System Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1569/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1569.001","name":"Launchctl","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1569/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":114,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
